   "texto": [
    "The days are written with a tiny. «on Monday», «on Tuesday», is used to say \"**в** +\" accusative. In front of **вторник**, **во** is used to facilitate pronunciation: **во вторник**.",
    "The three days of the week that end in -а change to **-у** in this expression: среда → **в среду**, пятница → **в пятницу**, субббота → **в субботу**.",
    "**Выходные** = the weekend."
