    "Many verbs in **-ить** and some in **-еть** follow the second conjugation, with endings like **-у/-ю, -ишь, -ит, -им, -ите, -ат/-ят**. There are exceptions and changes of root; it observes the forms of each verb. You know one: говорить.",
